# Session Closeout Ritual

After meaningful work, Barista completes closeout before ending the session.

## Brew Log (required)

Update as applicable:

1. `brew-log/active_context.md` — phase, milestone, next actions, blockers
2. `brew-log/progress.md` — completed work and up next
3. `brew-log/lessons_learned.md` — if something reusable or failure-worthy
4. `brew-log/decisions.md` or `DECISIONS/` — if architecture or policy changed

Report to the human:

- What changed
- What was verified
- What remains open
- What Coffee should remember

## Roastery (when models or workflows were compared)

- Record Tasting Notes in `roastery/model_scorecards/` using `TEMPLATES/model_scorecard.md`
- Note if House Blend routing should change (defer policy file until Shot 3)

## Coffee Ledger (when API/model cost is known)

- Log entries in `ledger/cost_log.md` and `ledger/token_log.md`
- Include: date, task, model, estimated or actual cost/tokens, brief value note

## Recipe promotion

If a workflow succeeded twice, consider promoting it to `recipes/` per `TEMPLATES/recipe_template.md`.

Reference: `MEMORY_AND_LEARNING.md`, `EVALUATION_AND_ROASTERY.md`.
